Modifications: the RGB stream of each recording was re-encoded to 704x704 H.264 at CRF 30 and
rotated 90 degrees clockwise to an upright frame; one poster frame and six evenly spaced stills
per SLAM camera were extracted from the same recordings. See ../DATA_LICENSE.md.
